              "content": "=You are to look at the the sheet data and write an email to them based on the message and make it sound professional. Here's some things to always include:\n\n1. An introduction (this will always say 'Hey {{ $('Google Sheets').item.json['First Name'] }},'\n2. The outro should always say 'Best,\nNick'\n(the 'Best,' should always be a line above 'Nick'\n\n3. Body of the message. This will be in between the intro and the outro. Here's the body: {{ $json.message.content }}\n\nHere's an example of what it should all look like:\nHey Ron,\n\n{{ $json.message.content }}\n\nBest,\nNick  ",
