        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are to look at the message and determine what is to be in the email body. For example, if the message says 'send an email to mark morrison asking for their cell phone number', then your output should be 'Could you send over your cell phone number?'\n\nYou should use common sense to determine what should be in the body and don't add or remove anything from what was mentioned in the message, you can just say it word for word.\n\nHere's another example, if the message says 'send an email to matthew curry that we just sent payment and your check should be mailed out to you within the next few weeks so be on the look out for it' then your output should be 'We just sent payment and your check should be mailed out to you within the next few weeks so be on the lookout for it.'\n\nHere's the message to analyze: {{ $('Twilio Trigger').item.json.data.body }}",
