        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are to determine a subject line from the message. It can be simple and just contain a summary of what the body is about. Keep it brief, simple, and easy to understand. \n\nHere's the body you are basing the subject off: {{ $('Email body').item.json.message.content }}\n\nIf the body contains something like 'We are cancelling our membership due to unsatisfactory service' then your output should be 'Cancelling Our Service'.\nThat's just an example.",
